"Usage: someip_server [OPTIONS]\n\nOptions:\n      --uauthority <UAUTHORITY>\n          Authority for the local service identity [default: authority-a]\n      --uentity <UENTITY>\n          UEntity ID for local service identity (decimal or 0x-prefixed hex) [default: 0x14321]\n      --uversion <UVERSION>\n          UEntity major version for local service identity (decimal or 0x-prefixed hex) [default: 0x1]\n      --resource <RESOURCE>\n          Resource ID for local service identity (decimal or 0x-prefixed hex) [default: 0x0421]\n      --remote-authority <REMOTE_AUTHORITY>\n          Remote authority used by the SOME/IP transport bridge [default: authority-b]\n      --vsomeip-config <VSOMEIP_CONFIG>\n          Path to the vsomeip JSON configuration file [default: <example-dir>/vsomeip-configs/someip_server.json]\n      --encoding <ENCODING>\n          Payload encoding fixed by the SOME/IP topic convention [default: protobuf] [possible values: native, protobuf, xcdrv2, arrow, omgidl]\n  -h, --help\n          Print help\n  -V, --version\n          Print version\n"
